45	      "answers": {
46	        "ui_testing": "Headless Chromium via Playwright (pre-installed in the environment): render the real single-page app — Leaflet map included, with map tiles and other network faked deterministically — and assert pixel-exact visual goldens the owner reviews by sight; short per-leaf tests drive to a state and capture. Pure planner rules (plan/lib) stay node --test logic leaves. No visual harness exists yet — this is the target mechanism.",
47	        "requirements_source": "Authored fresh at product/requirements.md (config.spec), distilled from the existing product brief docs/product-spec.md. No prior formal requirements doc or issue-tracker backlog to extract."
